version: "0.4.0-draft"
date-released: 2026-10-07
year: 2026
abstract: >-
  An open framework for representing and examining the total inquiry process,
  including how distinctions, observations, measurements, interpretations,
  conclusions, inquiry operations, allocations, evaluator/value judgments,
  selections, boundaries, stopping conditions, and revisions are produced and
  related. Recursive Truth Exposure is the framework's governing recursive
  operation. Problem solving is an application of the framework; representation
  integrity, epistemic alignment, recursive systems, and recursive
  self-improvement are specialized applications and research areas.
license: CC-BY-4.0
